			<div class="content" id="post-content-4820054">
									

<p>One idea I actually had in mind was to make the DJ group a GoI of some sort. They would make stuff like this anomaly- time capsules, possibly upon request or by some contract. The intent of the interviews could then be to learn more about the two and why they might be doing what they're doing, as well as where they are now. This would certainly add some stakes to the anomaly and give the Foundation a reason to want to learn more about it.</p>
<p>Your last suggestion is interesting, but first, I have to understand it: by PoV character, are you implying that the article would act like it was being interacted with, or maybe something that looks kind of like <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-139">SCP-139</a>?</p>
<p>I can at least explain why the Foundation would be doing what they're doing here. I don't know about drawing the reader in due to high stakes, but I can probably try to make the actions of the Foundation make sense and make the narrative flow normally. Thanks for your ideas!</p>

							</div>

								
					
