				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5813664); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605806666" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5813664); return false;" >PlaguePJP</a></span> <span class="odate time_1605801466 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">19 Nov 2020 15:57</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4822489">
									

<p>I'm willing to give a <span style="color: green"><strong>greenlight</strong></span> for this concept. I'd like to highlight a few things that are important.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The audio logs will explore the relationship between the two members of After Hours, developing their characters and showing their love for their work. In the end, it's revealed that the anomaly is a time capsule of some sort, meant to store the greatest moments of their lives.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This will be the crux of your story. You have to convey this clearly or else this article will have trouble gaining ground with a reader. Without this, you just have a ghost nightclub, which, don't get me wrong I like, would need a different tone, probably comedic, to work. With the more emotional side here, which once again is what your article should stand on, you need to give us characters that we can connect with.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Two people's love for music and each other is detailed as a faint memory through an eternal party. The anomaly is their happy ending- getting to perform for their fans and themselves until the end of time. It's an homage to parties and the love of musical expression that takes the reader on an emotional ride.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I believe this will do a suitable job of conveying the themes you're going for. Just be sure that the memory aspect is explored along with concluding with the end of time bit.</p>
<p>Overall, I see this succeeding, good luck!</p>

